{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1eMokg3HfuK8AN9ZGN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: build it, but ship it as a randomized rollout with a holdout. Spend a day or two on a few quick checks first, not a separate research phase.**\n\n**Why the evidence supports building:**\n- The email trial was a real randomized experiment. With about 400 patients per arm, late collection fell from 31% to 18%, a 13-point drop. That's roughly 4 standard errors, so it's very unlikely to be chance. Reminders work.\n- A push reminder is cheap and low-risk. Three weeks for two engineers is plenty for scheduling, wording, deep-linking and opt-in prompts.\n\n**What the trial doesn't tell you:**\n1. **Who it reaches.** The trial only covered patients who opted in to email. App users who allow push may be a different group. If most late collectors don't use the app or turn notifications off, the overall effect will be small even if each push works.\n2. **Whether push works like email.** Push is easier to ignore, and its timing and wording behave differently. The 13 points may not carry over.\n3. **Whether push adds anything on top of email.** If email reminders are already going out, for many patients the question is how much push adds, not push versus nothing.\n\n**Checks before building (days, not weeks):**\n- What share of late collections come from app users, and what share of those have push enabled?\n- Are email reminders already rolled out to everyone eligible? If not, that's a near-free win available today.\n\n**Build plan:** Randomly hold out about 20% of eligible patients from push, and measure late collection from pharmacy records (not app opens) over the next quarter. This answers the remaining questions while delivering value. If the checks show few late collectors can be reached by push, put the engineers on expanding email or SMS instead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3193,"cache_read_input_tokens":5027,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3193},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ef9d123-0bf3-4513-8c0d-70235dce5732","uuid":"e41bc7ef-2a49-4b93-ae4e-698bebcfc942","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:14:57.478Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1eMZ7WLTRvrw6oqqTR"}
